### Get all users
GET http://localhost:5264/users


### Get user by ID
GET http://localhost:5264/users/1


### Get user that doesn't exist
GET http://localhost:5264/users/999


### Create a user
POST http://localhost:5264/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Bob",
    "email": "bob@example.com"
}

s
### Create another user
POST http://localhost:5264/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Alice",
    "email": "alice@example.com"
}


### Delete user
DELETE http://localhost:5264/users/1


### Try to get the deleted user
GET http://localhost:5264/users/1